<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT MARCH NET UP TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT MARCH NET UP TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.60 vs   1.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.62 vs   2.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.49 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Sales		  197.63 vs 134.88</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.64 vs   9.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.36 vs  17.53</p>
<p> Operating profit    20.09 vs  16.39</p>
<p> Sales		  573.12 vs 394.30</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
